package be3:gpu@0.1.0;

/// The gpu an app draws with. It is answered inside the app's own worker
/// or thread on every platform (V8 fast-API host functions natively,
/// be-wasm-gpu-shim in a browser), so its funcs are direct wasm calls that
/// return their results: wasi:webgpu, and `host` for what it leaves out
/// (decisions/be3_gpu_is_wasi_webgpu.md).
world gpu {
    import wasi:webgpu/webgpu@0.3.0-rc.2;
    import host;
}
